    {
      "id": "claim_7c70625c72184874868a003ce10b4872",
      "statement": "Roles are totally ordered build > use; build collaborators get full access except they cannot delete the gadget, use their own AI models (BYOK bills whoever prompted), connect bindings through their OWN third-party accounts (newGatekeeper calls clientUser.getGatekeeperClassFor rather than the owner's), and can only remove users they themselves added — so no collaborator implicitly gains access to another user's connected accounts.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/sharing.md#L12-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1f1bf552ea2cf4a14e94d8fcb1e9b1d148935fcf0a135426adf5c1ba7ab93068:"
        },
        {
